Package: zusmt
Title: Bindings to the 'OpenSMT' Satisfiability Modulo Theories Solver
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("OpenSMT authors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "bundled OpenSMT sources; see LICENSE.note")
  )
Description: Bundles the 'OpenSMT' satisfiability modulo theories (SMT) solver
    <https://github.com/usi-verification-and-security/opensmt> and exposes it
    to R, so that solving does not require a separately installed solver
    binary.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://pedrobtz.github.io/zusmt/
BugReports: https://github.com/pedrobtz/zusmt/issues
SystemRequirements: GMP (>= 5.0.0), C++20
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
